  "versionNotes": [
    {
      "edition": ".NET 9, .NET 10, and .NET 11 LINQ additions",
      "items": [
        ".NET 9 added `CountBy`, `AggregateBy`, and ordering helpers including `Order` and `OrderDescending` to LINQ. .NET 10 added built-in `AsyncEnumerable` operators for IAsyncEnumerable<T>. .NET 11 added `FullJoin` and tuple-returning Join/GroupJoin overloads across Enumerable, Queryable, and AsyncEnumerable. These are library APIs, not C# language syntax; package and target-framework availability must be checked when multitargeting."
      ],
